{"code":0,"message":"SUCCESS","data":{"tab_index":0,"tab_item":[{"tab_type":8,"client_tab_type":0,"title":"找剧","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":401,"cell_name":"","cell_operation_type":1,"use_recommend":true,"cell_abstract":"","cell_id_str":"6952850996422770718","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":402,"cell_name":"小卡","cell_operation_type":0,"use_recommend":false,"video_data":[{"vid":"7485692531234065433","cover":"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/955dc94c1d34f0c9bb13d22b5eeedcf4~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:400:0.image?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1799163109&x-signature=p2pTvOz17OiughTJDJDf1yM2WtY%3D","duration":3688,"title":"三秋迟暮，候鸟无栖","video_desc":"宋景行因弟弟身染重病，无奈代弟嫁入将军府，只为求药救弟。谁料妻子叶轻眉在新婚不久，便弃他而去，与白月光私奔。三年转瞬即逝，叶轻眉竟携白月光大摇大摆归京，还妄图休夫。看到宋景行育有幼子，叶轻眉恼羞成怒，勾结他人对其恶意陷害，致幼子含冤惨死。就在宋景行孤立无援之际，女帝突然现身，当众揭穿宋景行真实身份，原来他竟是帝君，最终女帝严惩恶人，清算孽债。","series_id":"7485657174736112702","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106233148A4F01B9862FBEE8CFE57\",\"rank\":\"1\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7485657174736112702\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"staytime_stream\\\":0.9674400091171265,\\\"finish\\\":0.01322282012552023,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.056485626846551895,\\\"like\\\":0.04535258188843727,\\\"collect\\\":0.030214590951800346,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.714667797088623,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.09157242625951767}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7485657174736112702","play_cnt":113823,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"山海星辰","sub_title":"古装·虐渣","score":"8.1","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":35,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5007,\"name\":\"古装\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5007&categoryName=古装&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5176,\"name\":\"虐渣\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?